(A6 and L2 are NOT CHECKED — no case file for them here, A6 needs the held-back opencode cases and L2 is P5's measurement.)

Three changes, all in the copy's `src/`: `find` names the weaker ranked matches it left out in a limit at the first omitted place; `map` carries the dynamic limit for a computed call; the `tests` walk keeps its visit budget but says where and why it stopped (and call sites are memoized per file so long walks stay cheap).
